      "spam": false,
      "value": "I understand why you dislike the negative climates that can arise in certain instances, but this would literally change nothing except for the player-count. People can still buy the game and be toxic, raid, etc. Personally, I've had no ongoing problems with other players, because I block spammers, and if there's a raid going on in a world, I switch worlds.",
